- * See hw-report.md: volume-up is PM6150L SID 4, NOT PM6150 SID 0.
- * PMIC access is READ ONLY: the sole MMIO write issues EXT_READL on an
- * observer channel. No PMIC config, IRQ acknowledge or reset writes exist.
+ * Polled hardware keys for the Galaxy A13 (Exynos850).
+ *
+ * Volume up is gpa0-7 and volume down is gpa1-0 on the ALIVE pin controller
+ * (0x11850000), both active low. The power key is wired to the S2MPU12 PMIC
+ * (ACPM), which has no driver here yet, so pressing both volume keys together
+ * is reported as Power (lock/wake) and suppresses the two volume events.
+ *
+ * The pins are only read; the function mux is switched from EINT to plain
